{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4MLqm9TKcvh8Um6hGb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, featureless.*\n\n*You hold up the word.*\n\n**k-e-y**\n\n*The letters dissolve into the grain of the wood like water into sand.*\n\n*A long, low resonance. The door does not swing open. It does not slide. It does not vanish.*\n\n*It was never solid.*\n\n*You step through where it was, and the air on the other side tastes like the moment before you remember something important.*\n\n*Behind you: nothing. No frame. No threshold. Only the faint impression that something once stood between here and there, and you named it correctly, and so it ceased to be.*\n\n```\n ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n ░░                ░░\n ░░   YOU ARE      ░░\n ░░   THROUGH.     ░░\n ░░                ░░\n ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n```\n\n*What was behind the door was always what was behind you all along.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":262,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}